---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Islamic Dates"
  description="Privacy policy for islamicdates.org — how we collect and use data."
  canonical="https://islamicdates.org/en/privacy/"
  lang="en"
  arPath="/privacy/"
  enPath="/en/privacy/"
  urPath="/ur/privacy/"
>
  <div style="max-width:780px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px;font-family:inherit;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text)">
    <h1 style="font-size:28px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:32px">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 10px">Introduction</h2>
    <p><strong>islamicdates.org</strong> provides a free Hijri calendar and date converter service. This policy describes how we handle your data when you visit the site.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 10px">Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We do not collect personal data directly. However, third-party services used by this site may collect anonymous usage data:</p>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px;margin-top:8px">
      <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — to measure visitor counts and page views.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — to display relevant ads. Google uses cookies to personalize ads based on your browsing history.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 10px">Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site uses third-party cookies via Google Analytics and Google AdSense. You can disable them in your browser settings or via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent)">Google's Ad Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 10px">Advertising</h2>
    <p>This site may display ads via Google AdSense. Google uses interest data to show relevant ads. For more information, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent)">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 10px">Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking via the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent)">opt-out add-on</a>, or adjust your ad preferences <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent)">here</a>.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin:28px 0 10px">Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy questions, contact us at: <a href="mailto:fouadchor@gmail.com" style="color:var(--accent)">fouadchor@gmail.com</a></p>

    <p style="margin-top:40px"><a href="/en/" style="color:var(--accent)">← Back to Home</a> · <a href="/privacy/" style="color:var(--muted);margin-left:12px">عربي</a></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
